WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
Eight fictional tasks. Motion signals activity; color signals status.

00:03.200 --> 00:06.400
An amber task needs context. Select it to open the question in Codex.

00:06.400 --> 00:15.400
Dictate a reply, then review the draft in the app. No real microphone is used in this illustration.

00:15.400 --> 00:19.000
Send the answer in Codex. The task resumes and shows RUN.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.300
Open a completed response. READY becomes SEEN, which does not mean reviewed or approved.

00:24.300 --> 00:29.800
Open another question, choose a format in Codex, and send the answer.

00:29.800 --> 00:32.800
Select a completed task to open its response.

00:32.800 --> 00:36.800
Streamdex. Try the interactive demo or get the setup kit from github.com/danielsack/streamdex.
